OL,3,GNEWSATip trips to be booked in advance 
OL,4,Aunder new plan                         
OL,6,FVisits to Worcestershire household     
OL,7,Frecycling centres would need to be     
OL,8,Fbooked in advance under plans aimed at 
OL,9,Fsaving the county council around       
OL,10,F#500,000 a year.                       
OL,12,FWorcestershire County Council is       
OL,13,Fproposing to introduce a mandatory     
OL,14,Fbooking system at all 11 of its        
OL,15,Frecycling centres. The plans are due to
OL,16,Fbe considered by the cabinet on        
OL,17,FThursday.                              
OL,19,FIf approved, the changes could be      
OL,20,Fintroduced between February and the end
OL,21,Fof March.                              
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
