OL,3,GNEWSATip trips to be booked in advance 
OL,4,Aunder new plan                         
OL,6,FResidents would be required to book    
OL,7,Fbefore visiting a recycling centre,    
OL,8,Fwith an initial limit on how many      
OL,9,Fappointments could be made within a    
OL,10,F14-day period. The council said that   
OL,11,Frestriction would be reviewed depending
OL,12,Fon demand.                             
